cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "TGX Outputs: an automated output dashboard for the Department of Translational Genomics"
message: "If you reuse this, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  Collects the research output of a university department from public APIs -- OpenAlex,
  Zenodo, Bioconductor, ecosyste.ms, GitHub, the Research Software Directory and SPARQL
  endpoints -- applies a set of data-integrity rules, and publishes the result as a
  static site with every figure traceable to the query and dataset behind it.
authors:
  - given-names: Marvin
    family-names: Martens
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2230-0840"
    affiliation: "Department of Translational Genomics, Maastricht University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TGX-UM/tgx-outputs"
url: "https://tgx-um.github.io/tgx-outputs/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - research output
  - bibliometrics
  - research software
  - open science
  - FAIR
